(global_label "GND" (shape bidirectional) (at 91.44 143.51 0) (effects (font (size 0.85 0.85)) (justify left)) (uuid 281b0f09-6179-57d6-a82e-406c4cf156ba))
(text "RGB565 and 8-bit DVP use separate native IO-MUX buses (Espressif hardware guide, tables 11 and 12)." (at 16 165.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid e4fbd2f5-636c-5736-b45e-1a1cc4835618))
(text "HS OTG is on dedicated pads 44/45. GPIO33/34 are used by RGB after disabling their reset USB-Serial/JTAG function." (at 16 170.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 7fb4ba4b-0bdd-5db5-94ad-e323baaa5a2b))
(text "GPIO36 is both LCD red MSB and flash-voltage strap. R403 pulls it high for the 3.3 V NOR at reset." (at 16 175.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 28411674-8f3c-5b47-919c-3bbfecc5ea8a))
(text "GPIO37 and GPIO60 use the existing pulled-up SD select nets. GPIO61 low plus GPIO60 high selects joint download." (at 16 180.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid d70292c7-14ae-5bf1-b3b1-dececd0708b9))
(text "Use I2S0 for two microphone data lines and I2S1 for the full-duplex codec. SPI mode keeps GPIO20..25 at 3.3 V." (at 16 185.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid e16049a2-d62e-5aa7-abaf-3545b59dc25d))
(text "R3A RP2350B pin assignments are preserved. Radio is integrated and the former C6 is removed." (at 16 190.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid e7631c8e-c73e-522e-b738-864ed2e762d6))
